{# lede #}<span class="text-white">Enterprise Jamstack Wiki Platform</span>&nbsp; for <b>creating, managing, and delivering</b> static webpages using Jamstack Technology for dynamic features therein{# lede #}. For pricing information, see our [Orion Plans](plans).

### Here's the Pitch, Executive Decision Maker...

<span class="text-white">Why Choose Orion? The Jamstack Wiki Platform That Outperforms &mdash; and Costs Far Less</span>

What truly sets Orion apart isn't just another wiki platform &mdash; it's our proprietary Orion Technology, a battle-tested, patent-pending approach that delivers an elegant user experience with unmatched efficiency.

This lets us run ultra-low operating costs while offering superior editorial controls, enterprise-grade security, and groundbreaking features no legacy wiki can match. We pass those massive savings directly to you. Expect only modest, transparent upcharges for the exact cloud resources you use &mdash; no bloated pricing tiers or hidden fees.

Orion is built for leaders who refuse to settle:

- **University leaders** &mdash; Eliminate campus plagiarism and empower secure, open-access collaboration with version-controlled document sharing, curation, and online publishing. Transform your academic knowledge management into a modern, auditable, <span class="text-success">Open Science</span> platform.

- **Government &amp; defense IT decision-makers** &mdash; Meet FedRAMP infrastructure, NIST 800-207 zero-trust requirements, and fine-grained access controls on your version-control repository &mdash; all with FIPS 140-3 compliant security and installable inside your corporate VPN.

- **Marketing executives** &mdash; Run a fast, global, innovative enterprise platform for corporate website assets. Use Orion as a powerful headless CMS &mdash; secure, performant, and fully decoupled from frontend delivery.

- **Technology companies &amp; website agencies** &mdash; Replace insecure commercial wikis, tame mountains of product documentation, client sites, and even binary downloads. Curate everything with confidence, speed, and ironclad version history.

- **High-availability architects &amp; principled engineers** &mdash; Escape the single points of failure baked into SQL-based LAMP stacks. Embrace true Jamstack scalability: concurrent builds, incremental updates, global POP coverage, and peak performance measured in milliseconds.

- **Any business tired of wiki economics** &mdash; Ditch expensive SaaS subscriptions, fragile free tools that drain staff time, and outdated systems that slow your team down. Orion gives you enterprise power at a fraction of the total cost of ownership (often under $10,000/year for full enterprise use).

Zero vendor lock-in &mdash; and *we prove it*. Your content lives in clean Markdown and standard Version Control workflows. No proprietary formats. No migration nightmares.

Want transparency? See for yourself:

Our entire build-system logic for this very website: fewer than 100 lines of code, complete with sophisticated, memoized dependency management that auto-generates multilingual sitemaps, directory indexes, and more.

View the source: [our source lib tree](https://vcs.sunstarsys.com/repos/svn/public/cms-sites/www.sunstarsys.com/trunk/lib/), or its [<i class="fa fa-github fa-emoji" title="Github"></i> GitHub mirror](https://github.com/SunStarSys/www/tree/trunk/lib).

The underlying Static Site Generator: open-sourced on GitHub under Apache License 2.0 → @SunStarSys/orion

This isn't marketing spin &mdash; it's verifiable, open engineering heritage dating back to F/OSS innovations pioneered in 2011. Ready to experience a wiki that actually saves time, money, and headaches? [Give us a call or drop us a note](/contact) today.

