<div class="card border-success" style="max-width:25rem;background-color:transparent">
<div class="card-header">Getting Started</div>
<div class="card-body text-white">

The quickest way to get going is to play with @SunStarSys/orion's build of <https://iconoclasts.blog> and hollow out the sources in trunk/content.  ~90% of the styling customizations are in [`trunk/content/css/local.css`](https://github.com/SunStarSys/www.iconoclasts.blog/blob/trunk/content/css/local.css) &mdash; adjust to taste!

</div>
